<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19244" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Gallaeci</span></b>  (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Callaeci</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cal-laïci</span></b> ), ōrum,
		m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καλλαικοί</span> Strab.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a people in
				western</i> Hispania Tarraconensis, now <i>Galicia
				and part of Portugal</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 3,
				4, § 28</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Derivv. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Gallae-cus</span></b>  (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Gallaïcus</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Callaïcus</span></b> ), a,
			um, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to the</i> Gallaeci, (Call-), <i>Gallœcian</i> (Call-): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Gallaica gens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 42, 67, § 166</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Callaicum aurum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					4, 39, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Gallaica gemma,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					37, 10, 59, § 163</span></i>
			: Gallaecus, <i>a surname of A. Brutus</i>, <i>from his victory over the</i> Gallaeci, <i><span class="en">Vell. 2,
			5</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Gallaecia</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Call-</span></b> ), ae,
				f., <i>the country of the</i> Gallaeci,
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				4, 20, 34, § 112</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Flor. 2,
				17, 5</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
